os.<\/p><p>Permite la lectura y escritura simult\u00e1nea de tarjetas SD y TF, facilitando la gesti\u00f3n de archivos de manera \u00e1gil y efectiva.<\/p><p>Totalmente compatible en Windows y Mac, garantizando un rendimiento \u00f3ptimo en ambos sistemas operativos. Adem\u00e1s, su dise\u00f1o avanzado evita el sobrecalentamiento durante la lectura y escritura de datos.<\/p><p><br><\/p><h2>Especificaciones<\/h2><p><ul><li><b>Medidas del producto<\/b>: 80x21x10 mm<\/li><li><b>Color<\/b>: Gris<\/li><li><b>Test de Funcionamiento<\/b>: 100% testado<\/li><li>Bolsa retail con autocierre<\/li><li><b>Medidas bolsa retail<\/b>: 135\/180\/20 mm<\/li><li><b>Peso aprox. (kg)<\/b>: 0,020<\/li><li><b>Contenido del Paquete<\/b><\/li><li>1 x Lector de Tarjetas<\/li><\/ul><\/p><\/div><\/p>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"TOOQ","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":10.97,"unit_price_tax":10.97,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Perif\u00e9ricos","sub_category":"Lectores de tarjetas","quantity":0,"brand":"TOOQ","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_too-cr%20tqr-3001g_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":3.97}}},"8433281016279":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8433281016279",false],"wholesale_price":[3.24,false],"price":[10.24,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0",true],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:276590","Cat. IDs: 2","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 2","De